# Authors and Contributions

## Angela

Angela worked on the project documentation and timing diagram portions of the project. Her contributions included writing the README documentation, explaining the overall CPU design, describing the pipeline stages, documenting the ISA design, writing demo instructions, and creating the R-type, I-type, and J-type timing diagrams. She also helped revise the overall design diagram so that the signal names and controls matched the GitHub implementation.

## Derek

Derek worked on the main CPU implementation and the remaining technical design tasks. His contributions included the SystemVerilog design files, datapath implementation, controller/decoder logic, hazard and forwarding logic, cache and memory support, assembly program support, and testbench/simulation work.

